  "lei_pre_h_tachado": "The official site strikes through text that was replaced or repealed; copying without formatting loses the strike and the old text shows up next to the new. These passages were identified by the strike. Accepting removes them from the law (and keeps them in the decision history); refusing keeps them as ordinary text.",
