  "lei_pre_titulo_num": "Check the numbering of the pasted text",
  "lei_pre_ajuda": "Text copied from a PDF usually carries things that are not law (page headers, annexes) and article headings the reader does not recognise. Below is what the app SUGGESTS changing: what would go shows struck through in red, what would stay in green. Refuse whatever makes no sense — group by group or item by item. Nothing is saved until you finish.",
