  "vr_conf_aplicar": "Apply the published syllabus?\n\n{f} topics kept · {s} leave · {n} come in\n{e} topic(s) you studied leave the plan\n{r} remap(s) chosen\n\nNothing is erased: the diary stays whole and progress on departing topics stays stored in case they return.",
