  "cm_desfazer": "undo the last save",
  "cm_conf_sugestoes": "Accept all {n} suggestions at once?\n\nThey come from the cards' tags and work well when the topic has a long, specific name. When the name is short (\"Assets\", \"Action\"), the tag attracts cards from any subject. Check afterwards, or accept them one by one.",
  "cm_conf_desfazer": "Undo the save from {q}?\n\n{n} cards leave {t} topics.\n\nExactly what was saved that time comes out — material that already existed and anything you wrote afterwards stay untouched.",
  "cm_desfeito": "{n} cards removed from {t} topics.",
  "cm_titulo": "Save cards to study material",
  "cm_ajuda": "Cards are stored next to the topic's summary, tagged with the exam they were made for — so they come back at review time instead of disappearing into Anki.",
  "cm_qual_edital": "Which exam are these cards for",
