  "cm_dica_faltam": "{n} card(s) still without a destination. Pick the topic in the list, or use step 1 for the AI to suggest. If you prefer, save only those that already have one (step 3).",
  "cm_dica_colar": "Prompt copied. Take it to the AI and, with the answer, use step 2. {n} card(s) still without a destination.",
