  "ce_tip_at_risco": "Ticks cards with numbers, dates, percentages, amounts, articles, precedents or paragraphs — the ones that most need a fact check.",
  "ce_tip_at_repetidos": "Ticks cards that repeat others (same front or paraphrases). The AI can rewrite to tell them apart or merge; to delete, use “Repeated cards”.",
