  "ce_auto_msg": "{n} automatic format fix(es) in the answer.",
  "ce_sem_ancora_conf": "The answer came without the “@@ N” anchors, but with exactly {n} card(s), the same number you ticked. May I match them IN ORDER to the ticked ones? Check each before/after before applying.",
