  "cm_mel_def_sem_verso": "The card has no back and is not a cloze.",
  "cm_mel_def_cloze_repetida": "Two blanks in the same card use the same number.",
  "cm_mel_prompt": "FIX a malformed memorisation card. Same content, same point, only clean.\n\nPROBLEMS FOUND:\n{defeitos}\n\nRULES\n1. One card, one idea. If it joins two or three, return two or three cards, losing no fact.\n2. No formatting rules or instructions about HOW to make cards.\n3. No numbering, markdown or emoji.\n4. The question must be answerable without seeing the back.\n5. For cloze use {{c1::term}} with a DIFFERENT number per blank.\n6. Do not invent content.\n7. The \"+\" (learn more) and \"@\" (title) lines of the current card are content: return them in the same place.\n\n{padrao_corrigir}\n\nFORMAT — one card per line (with the \"@\" and \"+\" lines, if any):\nquestion :: answer :: tags\n\nUse EXACTLY these tags: {etiquetas}\n\nSUBJECT: {disciplina}\nTOPIC: {topico}\n\nCARD TO FIX:\n{atual}",
  "qm_julgue": "judge the following item:",
